"只有满足条件的文字回复才改发语音：由概率、对等、短回复阈值与最长时长共同决定。失败原因包括发送句柄未就绪、上传失败等。" = "Only text replies that meet the conditions become voice: probability, mirroring, the short-reply threshold, and maximum length all apply. Failures include an unready send handle or an upload error.";
