"将删除旧版 CosyVoice3 的模型、源码仓库、venv 与安装标记（约 %@）。音色与参考音、Qwen3-TTS 安装会保留，已生成的语音文件不受影响。" = "Deletes the legacy CosyVoice3 model, source repo, venv, and install marker (about %@). Voices, reference audio, and the Qwen3-TTS install are kept; generated voice files are unaffected.";
"会删除该音色的参考音、参考文本与清单条目，无法恢复；内置音色不可删除。" = "This deletes the voice's reference audio, reference text, and manifest entry. It cannot be undone. Built-in voices cannot be deleted.";
