"需先安装运行环境与模型（下载约 4.7 GB，运行时内存约 10 GB）；首次合成预热约 10 秒；CPU 后端极慢，可能超时并改发文字。" = "Requires the runtime and model (about 4.7 GB download, about 10 GB RAM); the first synthesis warms up for about 10 s; the CPU backend is very slow and may time out and send text instead.";
"模型在本机离线运行，不联网：MLX 模型约 4.2 GB、依赖约 0.5 GB，默认使用 GPU（MLX）。App 不内置音色：音色只保存在本机，需在「管理音色…」中添加。发布版内置安装与启动脚本；脚本缺失时可用 WECHATAI_COSYVOICE_SCRIPT / WECHATAI_COSYVOICE_INSTALL_SCRIPT 指定路径。" = "The model runs offline on this Mac: about 4.2 GB for the MLX model and 0.5 GB for dependencies, GPU (MLX) by default. The app ships with no voices; voices stay on this Mac and are added in “Manage Voices…”. Release builds include install and start scripts; if they're missing, point WECHATAI_COSYVOICE_SCRIPT / WECHATAI_COSYVOICE_INSTALL_SCRIPT at them.";
"将下载 MLX 模型（约 4.2 GB）与依赖（约 0.5 GB），合计约 4.7 GB，保存在本机；运行时内存约 10 GB。安装可能持续数十分钟，可随时取消，取消后已下载内容会保留。" = "Downloads the MLX model (about 4.2 GB) and dependencies (about 0.5 GB), about 4.7 GB in total, kept on this Mac; about 10 GB RAM at runtime. Installation can take tens of minutes; you can cancel anytime and downloaded content is kept.";
