"待发送" = "Pending";
"微信只下发会话 ID，App 无法获取真实昵称。自定义名称会用于列表、AI 提示词与日志。" = "WeChat only provides a conversation ID, so the App can't fetch the real nickname. A custom name is used in the list, AI prompts and logs.";
"将清空 App 内存中的日志（最多 2000 条）。已写入磁盘的日志文件不受影响。" = "Clears the in-app log buffer (up to 2,000 entries). Log files already written to disk are unaffected.";
"有新日志时自动滚动到底部" = "Scroll to the bottom when new logs arrive.";
"已暂停 · 显示暂停时的日志" = "Paused · showing logs from the pause point.";
"启用 / 写操作 / R3 原生发送已修改，重启机器人后才会同步到 bridge。" = "Settings changed: Moments enabled, write access, or R3 native sending. Restart the bot to sync them to the bridge.";
"读取、互动与发布是否就绪；点下方状态卡切换分区。" = "Whether reading, interaction, and publishing are ready. Select a status card below to switch sections.";
"开启后在「会话」下显示入口；关闭会同时停用自动发布与自动互动" = "Shows the entry under Conversations when on; turning it off also disables auto-publish and auto-interaction.";
"关闭后点图才下载；原图始终在打开大图时加载" = "When off, images download only on click. Full images always load when opened.";
"依赖 R3 原生发送：在「设置 → Hook」开启并重启机器人。" = "Requires R3 native sending. Enable it in Settings → Hook, then restart the bot.";
"bridge 随机器人启停，当前无法查询；启动机器人后点「重新检测」。" = "The bridge runs with the bot, so its state can't be queried now. Start the bot, then tap “Check again”.";
"已捕获请求体，可主动刷新；失效时回退被动缓存。" = "Request captured; active refresh is available and falls back to the passive cache if it expires.";
"打开一次朋友圈即可捕获请求体；未捕获前使用被动缓存。" = "Open Moments once to capture the request; until then, the passive cache is used.";
"读取最近一次手动打开朋友圈的响应，约 10 分钟有效；微信或 bridge 重启后需重开。" = "Reads the response from the last manual open of Moments (valid about 10 minutes). Open it again after WeChat or the bridge restarts.";
"请先在微信里打开一次朋友圈，再点「重新检测」。" = "Open Moments once in WeChat, then tap “Check again”.";
"「记忆库 → 记忆设置」里的「启用记忆卡」已关闭，朋友圈内容不会写入记忆卡；开启后才能在这里设置。" = "“Enable memory cards” is off in Memory → Memory settings, so Moments content won't be written to memory cards. Turn it on to configure this section.";
"仅当对方是私聊会话且已开启 AI 自动回复时写入；只写本机记忆库，不上传、不修改微信数据。" = "Only direct chats with AI auto-reply enabled are written. Data stays in the local memory library and is never uploaded or written back to WeChat.";
"当轮已有识图结果时一并写入；不会额外调用识图模型" = "Includes image descriptions already generated in this run; no extra vision requests are made.";
"关闭后停止写入，已有记忆内容保留。" = "Turning this off stops new writes; existing memory is kept.";
"开启后才会读取；关闭时不发起任何请求。" = "Reading starts after enabling; no requests are sent while off.";
"AI 自动评论与回复；默认关闭" = "AI comments and replies automatically; off by default.";
"需先开启「允许发布（写操作）」；开启时检测评论通道" = "Requires Allow posting (write). Turning it on checks the comment channel.";
"只对勾选的好友评论/回复；聊天黑名单中的好友永不互动" = "Only comments on or replies to selected friends; friends on the chat blocklist are never included.";
"候选为全部私聊会话，不要求开启 AI 自动回复；与聊天白名单相互独立。" = "All direct chats are candidates; AI auto-reply is not required. This list is independent of the chat allowlist.";
"评论与回复合计；只受最小间隔与检查间隔约束" = "Comments and replies combined; limited only by the minimum interval and check interval.";
"评论与回复合计；达到后当天停止互动，0 表示无上限" = "Comments and replies combined; interaction stops for the day once the limit is reached. 0 means no limit.";
"0 表示不限；按该间隔均匀分布" = "0 means no limit; interactions are spaced evenly by this interval.";
"评论前把动态图片交给识图模型分析（单条最多 9 张）" = "Before commenting, the post's images are analyzed by the vision model (up to 9 per post).";
"在「AI 模型 → 识图模型」中配置；识图只用于生成本次评论，不写入微信。" = "Configure it in AI Models → Vision Model. Descriptions are used only for this comment and are not written to WeChat.";
"图片识别已关闭：纯图片动态会被跳过，只用文字与评论生成" = "Image recognition is off: image-only Moments are skipped and only text and comments are used.";
"识图模型未开启：纯图片动态会被跳过；可在「AI 模型 → 识图模型」开启" = "Vision Model is off: image-only Moments are skipped. Turn it on in AI Models → Vision Model.";
"内容时效范围" = "Content age limit";
"超过该时长的动态与评论不再自动互动" = "Posts and comments older than this are no longer interacted with.";
"评论新动态不计入；仍受去重与频率设置约束" = "Comments on new posts don't count; deduplication and frequency limits still apply.";
"评论新动态不计入；0 表示无上限，避免同条动态反复回复" = "Comments on new posts don't count. 0 means no limit; this avoids repeated replies on the same post.";
"检查新动态与新评论的间隔；「立即检查」可立即执行一轮" = "How often to check for new posts and comments; Check now runs a round immediately.";
"按当前设置检查一次；已处理过的动态与评论不会重复互动" = "Runs one check with the current settings; already handled posts and comments won't be interacted with again.";
"只在本机内存，最多 30 条；重启 App 后清空" = "Kept in memory only, up to 30 entries; cleared when the app restarts.";
"只评论与回复，不点赞；失败后 10 分钟内不重试，同一目标最多尝试 3 次。" = "Comments and replies only, never likes. After a failure, no retry for 10 minutes, with at most 3 attempts per target.";
"尚未捕获朋友圈读取样本：先在微信打开一次朋友圈" = "Moments read sample not captured: open Moments once in WeChat first";
"评论通道未就绪：在微信里手动评论一次即可捕获" = "Comment channel not ready: comment once manually in WeChat to capture it";
"AI 自动发布朋友圈（仅文字）；写操作默认关闭" = "AI posts to Moments (text only); write access is off by default.";
