"开启后才能自动发布；改动需重启机器人后生效" = "Required for auto-posting; changes take effect after the bot restarts.";
"首次需在微信发布一次（可仅自己可见）以捕获发布样本" = "Post once in WeChat first (visible to yourself is fine) to capture a post sample.";
"捕获后自动发布复用该样本，无需再手动发布。" = "Auto-posting reuses this sample; no further manual posts are needed.";
